<title>USA: W.R. Grace &amp; Co names new CFO.</title>
<headline>W.R. Grace &amp; Co names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.R. Grace &amp; Co said Thursday it has named its senior vice president of strategic planning and development, Larry Ellberger, to the additional position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Ellberger succeeds Peter Houchin, who has decided to resign to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Houchin had overseen the recently completed spin off of Grace's packaging and specialty chemicals businesses and the combination of its former National Medical Care subsidiary with a unit of Fresenius AG.</p>
